      "title": "IRCON: Proposed RVNL Merger And Interim Dividend Will Shape Steady Outlook",
      "body": "Analysts have kept Ircon International's fair value estimate unchanged at ₹146, reflecting broadly stable assumptions on the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E in their latest price target update. What's in the News The Government of India is working on a proposal to merge Rail Vikas Nigam Limited and Ircon International to create a single, larger rail infrastructure company with combined project execution capabilities, technical expertise and financial resources (Key Developments).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
