      "title": "IRCON: Interim Dividend And Slightly Lower Fair Value Will Guide Measured Outlook",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their fair value estimate for Ircon International from ₹148.50 to ₹146.00, reflecting slightly different assumptions around revenue growth, discount rate and future P/E, while keeping profit margin expectations broadly similar. What's in the News The board will meet on 11 February 2026 to consider and approve unaudited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and nine months ended 31 December 2025, and to consider an interim dividend for FY 2025-2026 (company board notice).",
